WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:01.900
Wh-What did you just say?

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.990
I said make the contract.

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.200
Th-That means...

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.330
I'm ordering you to kiss Muneakira.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.250
A-Are you kidding? Why would you do something so lascivious?

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.170
Onii-sama genuinely wants to get rid of us.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:20.090
Even me, his little sister.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.050
If you don't want to die, you must fight.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:24.930
That's all there is to it.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.430
We'll discuss it with Muneakira.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.640
Please wait!

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.100
You don't want this? Then leave this dojo.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:39.020
If you value your safety, then that is the best plan.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.150
It's your choice, though.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.400
You must decide before tomorrow morning.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.280
Ohii-sama!

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:47.570
We don't have the luxury of arguing during a fight anymore.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:50.370
There was a message from Ooedo.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:54.000
In one week, Onii-sama will be returning from France.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:58.960
There's no time for us to dawdle around. Decide by tomorrow morning.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:00:59.790
All right?

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.460
Th-This isn't good...!

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:36.640
They're totally looking down on us.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.060
They're treating me like a traveler stopping by...

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:41.810
No, a pet dog!

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:48.740
All right.

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:53.490
Stand up, maidens!

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:55.410
This is a power struggle!

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.080
Now is the time to fight!

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:07.090
How about the three of us band together to defeat Yukimura for power, victory, and triumph!

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:10.590
Let's talk somewhere else.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.470
Maybe in the empty shed out back.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:15.760
Yeah, it's too noisy in here.

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:17.560
Noisy...?

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:25.110
I blindly jumped out of Yonezawa, so I can't just go back empty-handed...

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.900
Oh, it's Gutsugutsu-san!

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:33.360
Do you know what's for dinner today?

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:36.490
Here's a hint: it's something you really like, Gutsugutsu-san!

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:37.790
What's with the bags?

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.170
Are you leaving?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.340
You're going back?

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:48.340
N-No!

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:52.720
I was just letting my bags out to dry in the shade!

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:56.220
Oh, that's good.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:04:00.810
I thought you were going back to the country since your doggy house blew up.

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:03.940
I told you it's a cottage, not a dog house!

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:07.730
It's okay, Onii-chan will fix your doggy cottage.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:14.110
He's amazing! He can fix everything in a week no matter how broken it is!

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.490
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.910
What's wrong?

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.660
Gutsugutsu-san...

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.120
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.960
Wh-What is it?

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.250
Were you listening to Jyuubei?

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:31.130
I don't have a choice. I have to do this!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:35.300
The current power diagram shows that I'm in the very bottom layer.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.340
However!

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:42.100
If I kiss him and get the power of a master samurai, I'll be on the same level as Yukimura.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.190
No, I might even surpass them!

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:52.280
Doing it will be embarrassing for a moment, but not doing it will be embarrassing for the rest of my life!

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.690
In that case...

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:03.960
They totally ignored me!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.050
Kissing
Practice

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.130
No!

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.220
I-I'm sorry, I just...

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:24.770
Next time... I'll get it right next time!

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:27.020
So just one more time... okay?

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.860
This will be the fifth time...

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.150
Seems like we both have our troubles.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.480
The General's
Feelings

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:38.490
We must be horrible masters.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.240
Indeed.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:44.830
If Matabei kisses him and doesn't become a master samurai...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:49.000
If she doesn't have the required quality, are you going to chase her out?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.920
What about you?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.130
Geez!

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:56.130
Sen.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:01.510
What do you think about both of us having the quality?

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:06.640
There hasn't been a single one for over 20 years.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:11.360
But we were able to gain it in this short period of time.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.690
Doesn't it seem a little too convenient?

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:15.780
You're right...

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:16.780
Yeah.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:23.830
You're lowly in birth, upbringing, and the three sizes, yet you have the quality to become a master samurai.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.410
It's strange no matter how I think of it.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:27.830
I'm not talking about that!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.250
In other words!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.420
This is what I'm thinking!

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:33.960
Hot!

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.510
It's eatin' time!

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:37.170
Just a moment.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:40.840
I want to talk to you two about something before we eat.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.510
The topic is none other than you.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:48.100
Yes you, Muneakira.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:49.560
Me?

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:53.020
Your contract may change the person you kiss into a master samurai,

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:58.690
regardless of whether she has the needed quality or not.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.610
No way, I've never heard of that.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:05.490
I've never heard of a commoner having the power of a general, either.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:10.460
In order to confirm the extent of your power,

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:13.830
I want you to make a contract with Matabei and Hanzou.

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:15.090
Love

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.250
I guess I have no choice.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:20.260
The phenomenon concerning the master samurai is a matter of national security.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:23.680
I, Kanetsugu, am a very patriotic samurai,

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:28.520
so I will cooperate with you because there's just no other option!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:31.690
However, there are a few conditions!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:33.440
One!

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.650
Secure a place for me to live immediately!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:37.690
Two!

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.950
How many times have you ignored me?

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.120
All right.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:48.660
I'll ask Hanzou and Matabei-san from my end, too.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.040
That's not right...

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.540
Kissing someone when you don't even love them?

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:53.750
That's not right!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:58.750
Between a general and samurai, it doesn't even matter if they love each other or hate each other!

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:02.170
A real contract doesn't include kissing.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.180
The chosen general and samurai-

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.430
Onii-chan, you idiot.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:08.140
It's good because it's a kiss.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.600
It has to be a kiss!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:13.440
A contract is not what you are thinking of.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.860
It's a ritual, done with strict procedures.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.150
That's not right. That's different.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:23.740
Jyuubei, why are you stuck on kissing and the love they share?

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.160
I don't know.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.410
I don't know, but it's not right!

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:33.210
What is it?

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:34.330
An enemy?

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.590
Jyuubei?

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:38.920
This aura is...

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.510
Muneakira, where are you going?

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.380
Onii-chan...?

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:46.090
Don't, Muneakira!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.510
It's dangerous to go alone!

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:01.900
It's the same as that time! The same as with Jyuubei!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.250
Onii-chan!

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.420
An eyepatch...?

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.940
Don't!

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.110
Jyuubei...?

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.690
Don't...

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.360
Don't kiss that person!

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.330
The Next Morning

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.380
Changing Room

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.100
Good morning, Master.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:29.740
I'm sorry! I didn't think you were there!

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:36.870
It's all right, you may do as you wish to my breasts...

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:43.040
Master, you may fondle and touch and pinch them any way you want...

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:48.590
Of course, you can sandwich things with them too.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:52.340
Sandwich? Sandwich what...?

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:59.850
I could hardly sleep because of that woman...

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:04.520
Naked girls keep falling from the sky.

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.440
What is wrong with this country...?

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:08.990
The world's coming to an end...

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:12.910
Muneakira...

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.530
What are you...

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:18.080
Wh-What are you sandwiching...

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:21.620
I'm not sandwiching! I just got sandwiched!

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.920
Muneakira!

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.300
Hey! Wait!

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:30.340
Graceful Elegance!
No Regret of Corporeal Life!

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.590
N-No way...

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:35.550
Punishment

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:37.770
What's with that woman?!

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:41.980
Accepting her without doubting her at all just because she's also a Yagyuu...

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:43.480
There's a limit to how careless you can be!

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:47.110
<i>I am Yagyuu Gisen.</i>

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.440
<i>Nice to meet you.</i>

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:50.860
<i>Yagyuu?</i>

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.780
Punishment
Punishment

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:54.950
What's with that woman?!

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.080
Just remembering makes me angry.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:02.290
Accepting her without doubing her at all just because she appeared the same way as Jyuubei...

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:04.330
There's a limit to how careless you can be!

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:10.840
<i>Unfortunately, it seems as though I forgot everything other than my name.</i>

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:14.260
<i>By the time I noticed, I was in Master's arms...</i>

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.890
<i>That's not good.</i>

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:18.260
<i>You should stay here until your memory returns.</i>

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:21.640
<i>You're going to let this really suspicious person...</i>

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.480
<i>Live here with us?!</i>

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.400
Punishment

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:28.400
Just remembering makes me angry.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:31.280
You even start saying things like <i>that</i>...

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.320
You weren't being cautious at all!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.240
There's a limit to how careless you can be!

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.950
<i>I thank you for your generosity.</i>

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:48.880
<i>I couldn't possibly call this repayment, but you may use my body, from top to bottom, as you wish...</i>

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:51.010
<i>Master.</i>

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:55.380
That woman's crazy for sure!

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:58.970
You can't let your guard down ever, Muneakira!

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:00.350
Do you understand-

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:05.230
Muneakira...!

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:07.150
Muneakira, where the hell are you?!

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.320
Come out already!

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:12.230
That bitch...!

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:21.910
Why in the world are you-

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:25.120
You may not have a chance later, so how about you do your business now?

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.880
You don't have to worry.

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:33.210
Wh-Why are you stripping?

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:39.090
If you order it, Master, I will not hesitate to help you urinate.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.810
How could I make you help me with that?!

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:43.770
Really?

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:51.520
Generally, I heard that men are somewhat sadistic while women are somewhat masochistic.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:57.740
In other words, it means it's all right to make me do somewhat disagreeable things.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:00.910
Well then, excuse me.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.160
Where are you?!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:09.170
Muneakira!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:10.420
Here?

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.130
Gonna fuckin' kill!

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:17.880
Muneakira...

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:20.550
You...

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.930
You were sandwiching it again...?

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:27.100
I told you I'm not sandwiching it, I'm getting sandwiched!

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:30.770
Not once, but twice...

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.060
Unforgivable!

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:34.610
Hey!

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:36.740
Graceful Elegance!
No Regret of Corporeal Life!

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:38.860
N-No way...!

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:42.070
Punishment
Twirling Ascension!
Blasting Flash!

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:51.290
Thanks to her, nobody's focused on us making contracts.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:54.750
Oh, you two have returned?

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:59.340
What is it, what is it?

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:03.010
What can you see? Show me too!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:05.850
Give me some space!

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:07.180
Please be quiet!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.270
And you still say you follow the ways of Yamato Nadeshiko?!

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:15.610
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:22.490
No, serving the master is the greatest joy of a slave.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:28.950
Calling yourself a slave... unconscionable of a samurai.

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:34.590
You two are slaves of your master, just like me.

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:35.500
What?

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:36.420
Slave
Slave
Slave...?

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:42.590
You loyally sacrifice yourself for the master you made the contract with.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:48.140
The relationship between a general and a samurai is no different than a contract of slavery.

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:50.520
That is how I think.

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:52.310
How rude!

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.610
You've just spit on the pride of all samurai.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:57.020
I hope you aren't thinking you'll get away with this!

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:01.530
<i>Don't kiss that person!</i>

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:05.280
Why did I say that?

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:08.370
Is Jyuubei a mean girl?

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:13.250
I need to be friends with her, right?

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.210
Hurry up and take your stance.

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.210
I'll beat that rotten idea of yours into shape!

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:17.590
Senhime-san?

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:18.500
I'll beat that rotten idea of yours into shape!

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:27.800
Analysis Complete

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:28.810
Thirty-Two Thousand
Power Level

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:31.810
Hanzou-san, what's Gisen's power level?

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.520
Not worth mentioning.

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:36.900
Ohii-sama won't lose to a person of such low morals anyway.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:39.650
There's no need to worry.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:43.610
If the time comes, she can just use her powers as a master samurai.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:44.490
Got it.

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:46.910
What's wrong? Fight me already.

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:51.540
I cannot understand why you would be so angered.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:54.330
Fight me! I'll make you understand.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:08.760
Light!

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:12.470
Your sword doesn't carry the weight of the history of the samurai in it!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:18.770
400 years ago, the great leader Ieyasu said this upon creating the Ooedo shogunate:

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:22.480
"That which will be the foundation of Great Japan is the contract between samurai and general!

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:26.530
And that which will support it are two pillars.

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:27.320
They are trust and bonding!"

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.240
Trust
&
bonding

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:34.790
If someone has to explain that to you, you cannot consider yourself a samurai.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:36.920
Give up already!

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.550
The same aura as Jyuubei's?

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:54.930
Trust and bonding... Those words sound like you know samurai and slaves are the same thing

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:58.190
and don't want to admit it, don't they?

00:17:58.190 --> 00:18:01.110
Some make a contract ordered by their master.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.570
Some make a contract to become stronger.

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:06.450
Where is the trust and bonding in that?

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:08.610
Foolish words!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.450
It's just a contract.

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:13.160
Let go!

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.870
What difference is there from a slave?

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:21.290
Senhime-sama, please stop!

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:23.460
Muneakira, you be quiet!

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:32.010
Ohii-sama!

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.720
That was a Yagyuu technique!

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:35.430
It's the Swordless Grab.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.030
Stop, Gisen!

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:47.860
Ohii-sama, please run!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:50.610
Senhime-sama, please become a master samurai, quickly!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.120
Graceful Ele-

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.420
Jyuubei!

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.350
Ohii-sama.

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:19.020
Ohii-sama!

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:21.440
Please get a hold of yourself, Ohii-sama!

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.900
Yagyuu Jyuubei, eh?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:35.200
A general and samurai's contract needs trust and bonding.

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:38.080
Good one, Senhime-san!

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:44.710
Jyuubei's stupid so she couldn't say it yesterday, but I think that's what I wanted to say.

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:46.290
Jyuubei... you...

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:51.590
A general and samurai's contract isn't just a regular contract.

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:56.140
A general and samurai have to actually love each other.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:20:01.440
I think the samurai god made Onii-chan's contract in the wonderful form of a kiss

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:08.320
to remind everyone of trust and bonding; important things that everyone has forgotten.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:12.950
I'm impressed.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:15.870
I was wrong.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.750
From now on... please let me call you Onee-sama!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:23.580
You can't! You can't no matter what!

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.790
Do you understand what you did?!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.630
Well then...

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.760
Jyuubei will call you Gittan!

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:31.090
Yes, Onee-sama!

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:32.170
Gittan!

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:33.680
Onee-sama!

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.510
Gittan!

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:35.390
Onee-sama!

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:36.220
Gittan!

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:37.010
Onee-sama!

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:37.800
Onee-sama!
Her friendliness seems endless.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.140
Her friendliness seems endless.

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:42.520
Should I call her a philanthropist?

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:46.730
A contract does not have form, for it is love itself!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:51.940
It seems you finally understood what I was trying to say, Jyuubei-san.

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:55.320
Why are you trying to take the good part?

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.780
Why can't she just die...?

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:59.120
What did you say?!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.370
She said idiots can go die!

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:02.660
What?!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.380
Yukimura-sama, aren't you taking it a little too far?

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:10.380
Idiot, this is nothing!

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:12.210
Matabei, join me!

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:12.960
Right away!

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:18.510
Another Yagyuu; one who came falling from the sky just like Jyuubei.

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:23.810
I don't want to doubt her, but I should keep my guard up and watch her for a while longer.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:29.230
But that aside... Jyuubei, what in the world are you...?

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:13.590
Gittan, why do you call Jyuubei "Onee-sama"?

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:17.380
It's because the swordmaster Yagyuu Jyuubei of the past was actually Gisen's half-brother.

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:17.920
Really?

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:22.390
Of course, there are cases in which one calls another "Onee-sama" to express family-like love even when there is no blood relation.

00:23:22.390 --> 00:23:28.520
Commonly known as "yuri", the perverse loving between two women is quite popular among some men.

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:33.520
By calling you Onee-sama, Gisen is making an appeal to that part of the audience.

00:23:33.520 --> 00:23:36.110
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran: The General's Return.

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:39.360
Onee-sama, you didn't really understand that, did you?
